21282      /* STAT-GEE-003: GEE — CLASS / MODEL
21283       * Source: S154 / Chapter 50 / `CLASS Statement` (PDF pp. 3428–3429); S154 / Chapter 50 / `MODEL Statement` (PDF pp. 3435–3438).
21284       * Discriminates: Getting Started; explicit statements: CLASS, MODEL
